    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/5f5d4926743c555327057f6d492af7a1.poster.avif?t=1742751394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/5f5d4926743c555327057f6d492af7a1.webm?t=1742751394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/5f5d4926743c555327057f6d492af7a1.mp4?t=1742751394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>About this game</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phoenix: The Fall </strong>is a multiplayer  FPS that combines intense combat with a tactical, team-based experience in a captivating near-future world. Immerse yourself in the harsh atmosphere of a raging conflict, where you'll navigate decaying urban landscapes and engage in battles for control of key objectives. Experience the full weight of war in a world where technology has spiraled out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/7cf3b02e12c4a75509cff00ab426720f.poster.avif?t=1742751394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/7cf3b02e12c4a75509cff00ab426720f.webm?t=1742751394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/7cf3b02e12c4a75509cff00ab426720f.mp4?t=1742751394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense close-quarters combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical team-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visceral and immersive firefights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Near-future city setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertical urban environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community-driven development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique handcrafted gun sounds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vast arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple sides of the conflict </p></li></ul>",
